## macOS
# https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Global/macOS.gitignore
#
# Upstream matches `Icon\r` with a literal carriage return, which editors and
# line-ending normalisation silently strip. `[! -~]` matches any single byte
# that is not printable ASCII instead, so this file stays plain text. It still
# matches `Icon\r` but not `Icon`, `Icons` or `Icon1`.

